<title>USA: Western Pacific March cargo volume rose.</title>
<headline>Western Pacific March cargo volume rose.</headline>
<dateline>COLORADO SPRINGS, Colo. 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Western Pacific Airlines Inc said Monday its mail and cargo volume for March increased 126 percent compared to the same period last year.</p>
<p>The company said it carried 615,384 pounds of mail and cargo last month, up from 272,560 pounds in March 1996.</p>
</text>
